OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after man
OL,4,Afalls from balcony
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted murder after a man fell from
OL,8,Fa balcony.
OL,10,FPolice were called to reports that the
OL,11,Fman had fallen at flats on Liverpool
OL,12,FStreet in Salford shortly after
OL,13,Fmidnight on Saturday, Greater
OL,14,FManchester Police (GMP) said.
OL,16,FEmergency services attended and the man
OL,17,Fwas taken to hospital with
OL,18,Flife-threatening injuries, where he
OL,19,Fremains in a critical condition, the
OL,20,Fforce said.
